# The platform's side is 0.51 m, just over walk.climbMax: running into it stops you. Jump (K)
# while pressing forward and the ledge is within reach of the raised feet: climb up.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 20.5 10 0.13 270
tap walk 10
hold up 20..170
tap ollie 180
hold up 180..300
run 300
expect no event climb within 0..175
expect event jump within 180..182
expect event climb within 181..230
expect skater.pos.z > 0.62 at end
expect skater.pos.x < 17.8 at end
